          "text": "鸟儿叫，花儿笑，森林里面好热闹。",
          "image": "images/liang-zhi-xiao-xiang/01.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "两只小象比力气，老鼠一旁来打气。",
          "image": "images/liang-zhi-xiao-xiang/02.jpg"
        },
        {
          "text": "两只小象齐用力，嗨哟嗨哟嗨嗨哟。",
          "image": "images/liang-zhi-xiao-xiang/03.jpg"
        }
      ]
    }
